      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 1991, Bancroft founded the Ann Bancroft Foundation to support the educational mission of the historic all‑women’s 1993 Antarctic expedition.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
