      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ann_Bancroft"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Ann Bancroft, born in 1955, is a celebrated adventurer who was the first woman to finish multiple Arctic and Antarctic expeditions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ann_Bancroft"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During 1992‑93, Bancroft led the first all‑female expedition to the South Pole on skis.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ann_Bancroft"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2001, Bancroft and Liv Arnesen became the first women to ski across Antarctica.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ann_Bancroft"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Bancroft’s museums let visitors explore the town’s rich history through exhibits and artifacts.",
